{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日付変わった！3月8日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんの日でしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自由ということ 発売日だぁぁぁぁぁぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はフラゲ日でしたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう手元にある人もいるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2017/03/08/0072886/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日から渋谷TSUTAYAさんでも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売記念パネル&衣装展示がされているそうです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、1Fと6Fの2フロアに渡って展示が！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても嬉しいです（ ; ; ）♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、サインを入れてパネルをプレゼント！なんてキャンペーン応募も出来るそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く私も見に行きたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サインもしてこなくちゃ～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷TSUTAYAの展示は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2017年3月13日(月) 26時閉店までです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の22時～SHOW ROOMやります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も生放送させて頂きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫かな！かなり心配！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、あまり気負いせずネットだからこそ出来るユルさ。自由さ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コレが、自由ということだ～！と言う放送になればと思うので是非参加してみてください☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更にもう１つ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日発表になりましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2017年度 NHK Eテレ「テレビでハングル講座」に生徒役で出演させて頂きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スノク学園の転入生なのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子生徒は私が初めてなんだとか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩方からのバトン、しっかり繋げて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年間しっかり学んできます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直ハングルは全くわからず、本当に基礎からのスタート。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になるけど難しそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今更聞けないギモン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから1年間一緒に楽しく頑張りましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHK Eテレ「テレビでハングル講座」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本放送：水曜よる11時30分"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再放送：金曜あさ6時（放送時間は25分間）初回放送：2017年4月5日（水）再放送：2017年4月7日（金）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わぁ～盛り沢山！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステキですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2017/03/08/0072886/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、また！"}],"source":"archive"}